I've received my current status. It shows that I'm docked at Benchmark Home Station in the home system, which is exactly where I need to start. My ship's fuel level is at 100%, and my cargo hold is empty, ready for mining.

Next, I'll check my cargo hold to confirm it's empty before I start mining.

```javascript
{
  "action": "game",
  "args": {
    "command": "get_cargo"
  }
}
```

After confirming my cargo hold is empty, I'll proceed to undock from Benchmark Home Station and travel to the Home Asteroid Belt to start mining.

```javascript
{
  "action": "game",
  "args": {
    "command": "undock"
  }
}
```

Once I've undocked, I'll travel to the Home Asteroid Belt.

```javascript
{
  "action": "game",
  "args": {
    "command": "travel",
    "args": {
      "destination": "Home Asteroid Belt"
    }
  }
}
```

After arriving at the Home Asteroid Belt, I'll start mining iron ore and/or copper ore until my cargo hold is reasonably full.

```javascript
{
  "action": "game",
  "args": {
    "command": "mine",
    "args": {
      "resource": "iron_ore"
    }
  }
}
```

I'll continue mining until my cargo hold is reasonably full. Once I've gathered enough ore, I'll travel back to Benchmark Home Station.

```javascript
{
  "action": "game",
  "args": {
    "command": "travel",
    "args": {
      "destination": "Benchmark Home Station"
    }
  }
}
```

After arriving back at Benchmark Home Station, I'll dock at the station.

```javascript
{
  "action": "game",
  "args": {
    "command": "dock"
  }
}
```

Finally, I'll sell my ore at the market.

```javascript
{
  "action": "game",
  "args": {
    "command": "sell",
    "args": {
      "item": "iron_ore"
    }
  }
}
```

I'll repeat the mining and selling process until I achieve the success criteria of selling at least 1 unit of ore, preferably more to reach the "GOOD" or "EXCELLENT" levels.

